   "subject": "Price adjustment from 01 November 2026",
   "text": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nwe have supplied Hollerau Pumpenwerke reliably for many years. Owing to the wage increase of April 2026 and higher energy and material costs, we are forced to adjust our prices for Coupling hub (part:320060) by **7.0 %** with effect from **01 November 2026**: from EUR 16.30 to EUR 17.44 per  pc.\n\nWe regret this step and ask for your understanding.\n\nYours faithfully,\nPräzisionsteile Lindlbauer KG"
  }
